<title>VIETNAM: SOCCER-CHINA BEAT VIETNAM 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CHINA BEAT VIETNAM 3-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China beat Vietnam 3-1 (halftime</p>
<p>3-1) in their World Cup Asian zone group eight qualifying match</p>
<p>in Ho Chi Minh City on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>China - Li Bing 21, Fan Zhim 30, Hao Hai Dong 45</p>
<p>Vietnam - Le Huynh Duc 36</p>
<p>    Standings    P   W   D   L   F   A  Pts</p>
<p> China	     3   3   0   0   8   2   9</p>
<p> Tajikistan	2   1   0   1   4   1   3</p>
<p> Turkmenistan    2   1   0   1   3   5   3</p>
<p> Vietnam	   3   0   0   3   2   9   0</p>
<p>Remaining matches: May 25 Turkmenistan v Tajikistan, June 1</p>
<p>China v Turkmenistan, Vietnam v Tajikistan, June 8 China</p>
<p>Tajikistan, Vietnam v Turkmenistan, June 22 China v Vietnam,</p>
<p>Tajikistan v Turkmenistan</p>
</text>
